message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "TOVBrachistochrone: verification suite for brachistochrones inside static stars"
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-14
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.21797700
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ImanetorX98/TOVBrachistochrone"
authors:
  - family-names: Rosignoli
    given-names: Iman
    affiliation: "Department of Physics, University of Pavia"
keywords:
  - brachistochrone
  - general relativity
  - optical metric
  - Schwarzschild interior
  - hyperelliptic integrals
  - reproducibility
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package of the paper "Brachistochrones inside static stars: existence, global minimality and exact
  results for two uniform-density interiors". Wolfram Language scripts check every symbolic identity, threshold and
  number of the paper; a single Python entry point runs them in profiles quick, full and release and validates the
  JSON results against a reviewed manifest. The DOI above is the concept DOI of all versions.
